/*
  PDFRender - document layer: xref, object loading, page tree,
  stream decoding.

  The whole file is held in memory (caller-owned buffer); objects are
  parsed lazily on first reference and cached.  Handles classic xref
  tables, xref streams (PDF 1.5+), hybrid files, object streams, and
  chained /Prev sections.  Encrypted documents are decrypted where the
  user password is empty (see h/pdfcrypt); one that genuinely needs a
  password is refused cleanly.

